WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:17.799
Water was filling the boat.

2
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.942
It reached Tom's knees.

3
00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:26.821
The prince climbed onto a barrel.

4
00:00:26.822 --> 00:00:31.843
"Help!" he yelled. "I'll drown!"

5
00:00:31.844 --> 00:00:39.729
Tom waved his wand. "Water, flow away!"

6
00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.483
The water flowed away from Tom.

7
00:00:42.484 --> 00:00:45.632
But it flowed toward the barrel.

8
00:00:45.633 --> 00:00:48.630
Now the water reached the prince's knees!

9
00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:50.836
"Oops!" Tom said.

10
00:00:50.837 --> 00:00:55.939
"Help!" the prince called. "Save me!"

11
00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:58.474
Cat looked at the net.

12
00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:01.741
"The fish are too heavy," she said.

13
00:01:01.742 --> 00:01:04.539
"You must let them out of the net."

14
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.661
Tom tried to open the net.

15
00:01:09.662 --> 00:01:12.684
"There is a big knot!" he said.

16
00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:18.490
The boat was sinking fast.

17
00:01:18.491 --> 00:01:20.986
Cat leaped onto the net.

18
00:01:20.987 --> 00:01:28.899
Tom lifted his wand. "Rise, boat!"

19
00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:31.099
Cat bit a big hole.

20
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.736
Then she ripped the net open.

21
00:01:33.737 --> 00:01:41.226
The fish quickly swam out.

22
00:01:41.227 --> 00:01:46.442
The boat began to rise!

23
00:01:46.443 --> 00:01:50.107
"You saved me, Tom!" the prince cried.

24
00:01:50.108 --> 00:02:00.668
"I want to go home and finish my lessons."

25
00:02:00.669 --> 00:02:03.798
The king and queen sat on their thrones.

26
00:02:03.799 --> 00:02:07.462
Prince Eric was working hard.

27
00:02:07.463 --> 00:02:10.227
The queen smiled happily.

28
00:02:10.228 --> 00:02:13.515
"Thank you, Wizard," she said.

29
00:02:13.516 --> 00:02:15.876
"I don't know what you did.

30
00:02:15.877 --> 00:02:20.597
But now Prince Eric is doing all his lessons!"

31
00:02:20.598 --> 00:02:23.262
"Yes, Tom," the king said.

32
00:02:23.263 --> 00:02:27.803
"Eric is working hard—like me!"

33
00:02:27.804 --> 00:02:32.700
Tom bowed.

34
00:02:32.701 --> 00:02:45.630
"The prince will be a fine king someday," he said.
